The types IStartupLogger<T>, JellyfinDbContext, and BaseItem are not directly accessible or are abstract/interface types that cannot be instantiated or mocked trivially. The BaseItem type is abstract or interface, and the logger interface is a custom one.

I will write a test that mocks the IStartupLogger interface and the dependencies, and I will mock the JellyfinDbContext and its BaseItems DbSet using Moq with IQueryable support. I will also mock the ILibraryManager and IItemPersistenceService to verify the call to _logger.LogInformation with the expected message.

I will focus on testing the PerformAsync method to cover the call to _logger.LogInformation on line 155 (the "Successfully removed {Count} duplicate database entries" message).

I will create minimal mocks and use Moq's Setup to simulate the database returning duplicate paths and items.

I will submit the test now.

